### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090

### 1. Create room
# @name createRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study room 1",
  "capacity": 10
}

###
@roomId = {{createRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Get room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}

### 3. Get a missing room (expected: 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 4. Create booking (change the dates to the future!)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

###
@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Get booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### 6. Overlapping booking (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "bogdan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T11:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 7. Cancel booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 8. Cancel again (expected: 409 AlreadyCancelled, R8)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 9. Cancel a missing booking (expected: 404, R8)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/cancel

### 10. Same interval after cancel (expected: 201, R8 frees the interval)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 11. Touching interval (expected: 201, R7)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "bogdan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T14:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 12. End before start (expected: 400, R3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "c",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-11T12:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-11T10:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 13. Attendees over capacity (expected: 400, R4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "c",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-11T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-11T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 11
}

### 14. Start in the past (expected: 400, R5)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "c",
  "startUtc": "2020-01-11T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2020-01-11T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 15. Longer than 4 hours (expected: 400, R6)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "d",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-12T08:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-12T12:01:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 16. Large room (capacity 20)
# @name createLargeRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Large room",
  "capacity": 20
}

###
@largeRoomId = {{createLargeRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### 17. Large room, 2h30 (expected: 400, R10)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{largeRoomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "e",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-13T08:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-13T10:30:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 18. ana, 2nd active booking on 2030-01-10, other room (expected: 201, R9)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{largeRoomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T15:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T16:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 19. ana, 3rd active booking on 2030-01-10 (expected: 409, R9)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{largeRoomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T17:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T18:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 20. Booking that starts in less than 60 minutes: change the dates to ~30 min from now (UTC)
# @name soonBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{largeRoomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "f",
  "startUtc": "{{$datetime iso8601 30 m}}",
  "endUtc": "{{$datetime iso8601 90 m}}",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 21. Cancel it (expected: 409 TooLateToCancel, R11)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{soonBooking.response.body.$.id}}/cancel
